  "POLYID identifies the MDP parcel polygon, not the SDAT assessment account; the account field is deliberately not used (it is blank or ROW on some polygons and repeated across distinct polygons in Gaithersburg).",
  "POLYID stability across MDP releases is not documented; the polygon date is in the source polydate field (not requested).",
